Attack your foes in a frontal arc with a spinning backhand, doing [131%, 144%, 154%, 162%, 170% (TL1-5)] damage. If you're not adjacent to the target, you'll step forward as you spin, gaining up to [43%, 43%, 50%, 50%, 56% (TL1-5)] bonus damage, which increases the farther you move.

This attack will remove any grapples you're maintaining, and earn one combo point (or one combo point per attack that connects, if the talent level is 4 or greater).
